<title>USA: Tropical Cyclone shipping threat in Indian Ocean.</title>
<headline>Tropical Cyclone shipping threat in Indian Ocean.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 14S has formed east of Madagascar in the South Indian Ocean near longtitude 14s, latitude 55e, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>The cyclone was moving west-southwest at seven miles per hour and was expected to intensify further, increasing its threat to shipping.</p>
</text>
